n=A.tK("Unani Quiz Bank is a cross-platform educational app built with Flutter, designed to help students and practitioners strengthen their knowledge of Unani medicine through structured quizzes. The app offers multiple quiz formats covering core Unani concepts as well as selected topics from modern medicine, making learning both comprehensive and engaging.\n\nUser progress and quiz data are securely managed using Firebase and Cloud Firestore, ensuring reliable performance and real-time data synchronization. With a simple, intuitive interface and seamless support for both Android and iOS devices, Unani Quiz Bank provides an efficient and accessible platform for self-assessment and continuous learning.",A.b([i,"Secure login and sign-up using Firebase Authentication","Personalized profiles with quiz history tracking","","QUIZ SYSTEM","Subject-wise and category-wise quiz selection","Multiple quiz modes: practice and test","","QUESTION MANAGEMENT","Real-time question bank stored in Firebase Firestore","Dynamic loading of questions for smoother performance","","PERFORMANCE TRACKING","Instant scoring and result display after each quiz","Progress history to track improvement over time","","USER EXPERIENCE","Clean, responsive interface for better engagement","Lightweight design optimized for mobile use"],h),"assets/images/unani_icon.png","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.unanimedstudy.unaniquizbank",j,["assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/login_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/register_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/home_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/select_mode.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/quiz_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/leaderboard_screen.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/unani_quiz_app/profile_screen.jpg"],n,"Unani Quiz App")
m=A.b(["Android","MySQL","Arduino","Node MCU","PHP APIs"],h)
m=A.tK("A smart home automation system that enables wireless control of household appliances and real-time monitoring of environmental conditions. Built using Android, Arduino, and NodeMCU, the system allows users to control devices like lights, fans, and doors via a mobile app, while sensors detect motion, fire, smoke, and light levels to enhance home security and automation. The project was demonstrated through a realistic miniature house model simulating a fully connected smart home.",A.b(["SMART DEVICE AUTOMATION","Remotely control home appliances like lights, fans, and doors via an Android app","Real-time switching using Wi-Fi-based communication through NodeMCU","","INTELLIGENT SECURITY MONITORING","Detects unauthorized motion using PIR sensors for intrusion alerting","Integrated fire and smoke sensors for proactive hazard detection and safety","Ultrasonic sensor monitors distance for real-time object detection or doorway control","","AUTOMATED ACCESS CONTROL","Servo motor-based smart door lock system controllable via mobile","Enables remote and touchless entry management for enhanced convenience","","USER-FRIENDLY AND REALISTIC SIMULATION","Built and tested on a miniature house model simulating a real home setup","Demonstrated seamless integration of multiple IoT modules working in sync","","LOW-LATENCY CONNECTION","Instant feedback and control using efficient Wi-Fi protocol via NodeMCU","Ensures reliable performance even with multiple simultaneous device interactions"],h),"assets/images/home_automation_icon.png",j,["assets/images/home_model_1.jpeg","assets/images/home_model_2.jpeg","assets/images/home_model_3.jpeg"],["assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/signup.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/login.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/home_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/light_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/fan_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/sensor_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/light_history.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/pir_history.jpg"],m,"Home Automation System")
